    "body": "Well, there's already a layer you're imposing on top---whatever layer is doing the \"[]\" stuff, and is translating lists-of-single-string-values into just string values. That isn't in this standard. My suggestion is to work with whatever community is responsible for that layer, to extend it to support additional semantics that you'd like. That commmunity isn't really related to this repo though, so here is probably not the right place. This repo is fully about the model I outlined above, since that model is the one browsers use.",
